      "subject": "להבת שלהבת",
      "rationale": "Hibru i ritim wanpela tok tu klos klos — 'lehavt shalhevet' — paia bilong paia; Tok Pisin i no inap holim nupela mining."
    },
    {
      "kind": "invitation",
      "subject": "yu harim tok bilong Yahwe",
      "rationale": "Tok i singautim bus bilong Negev bilong harim — pasin bilong singaut."
    },
    {
      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "olgeta pes bai ol i bim",
      "rationale": "Min bilong 'pes' i no klostu — tok i min olgeta man we ol i stap long em, o pes bilong olgeta man i senis klostu."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na yu tokim bus bilong Negev: Yu harim tok bilong Yahwe: Olsem Adonai Yahwe i tok: Lukim, mi painim paia long yu, na em i ken kaikai long yu olgeta diwai i gat wara, na olgeta diwai i drai; em i no ken mate, paia i sot olgeta; na olgeta pes, long saut i go long nort, bai ol i bim long em.",
